&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Differentiate how Mercury shows up in market&lt;/strong&gt; — develop a media and distribution approach that stands apart from the standard playbook and lets us outmaneuver competitors who outspend us, through unconventional channels, formats, partnerships, and creative use of the media we buy.&lt;/li&gt;
