&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the measurement system&lt;/strong&gt; — establish a rigorous framework for attribution, incrementality, and optimization that can support spend at the magnitude we aspire to, and leverage learnings to drive our investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect media to the broader marketing ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt; — integrate paid media with brand, performance, community, content, lifecycle, and product marketing so that media amplifies what the rest of the team creates rather than running in parallel to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
