&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have deep media expertise&lt;/strong&gt; — 15+ years building and running a media investment strategy on a fast-growing budget, with a proven track record delivering and measuring short-term wins while putting systems in place that last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a market leader, not a best-practices follower&lt;/strong&gt; — you find the unique, high-impact approach others haven&#39;t thought of, and you have examples of media work that was recognized as differentiated&lt;/li&gt;
