&lt;li&gt;Build a personal banking experience so good that people tell their friends and colleagues about it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the metrics, product strategy and the propositions we take to our customers, covering personal money management, banking, savings, investments, money movement, and in the future, lending&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the craft bar: sweat the details — copy, latency, empty states — that decide whether a consumer product feels inevitable rather than adequate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the use of AI in products where it makes the experience meaningfully better&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale the org: recruit and lead a high-performing PM team, instill strong build discipline, develop future leaders, and set a cadence and culture that drives pace and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the business: own acquisition, activation, retention, and the loops that compound,&amp;nbsp; including how personal banking connects to the businesses Mercury already serves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make reliability and trust product features: own uptime, correctness, latency, and support outcomes, and be measured on them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the ecosystem: bring product, engineering, design, data, risk, compliance, legal, marketing, support, and partners behind one cohesive strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
