&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consumer product leader with taste: you have built products millions of people chose to use, and can point to the decisions that made them work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have shipped AI-led products to real consumers and have opinions about what AI makes possible and where it fails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptionally high bar for craft, and a customer-centered, data-driven, and experimentation-oriented approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years building consumer products, including time owning a product&#39;s growth and economics, not only its roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years leading product managers: hiring, coaching, org design, and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching and scaling 0-1 products, alongside operating a large product with real customers on it&lt;/li&gt;
