&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: banking, payments, or fintech experience. We can teach you the rails; we cannot teach product judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment in a regulated environment: you balance a delightful experience with the controls a banking product requires, and know which corners are never worth cutting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
