&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Sales Recruiter to help build and scale that team. You&#39;ll own full-cycle searches across our sales organization, from high-volume roles like Sales Development Representatives to Account Executives and post-sales roles like Relationship Managers and Account Development. You&#39;ll work closely with hiring managers and senior recruiters, run searches end to end, and help improve how our recruiting team operates as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a good fit for someone who is organized, proactive, and comfortable owning their work. You should enjoy learning a new business quickly, work well with autonomy, and care about giving every candidate a thoughtful experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
