&lt;li&gt;Review Overlimit transactions through a dedicated queue, evaluating account history and risk signals, and requesting supporting documentation as needed, to approve or reject within required cutoff times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and decision remote check deposits submitted by users utilizing internal tools, and third party systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a high-volume caseload within service level agreements and with critical attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
