&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Recruiter to help build and scale those teams. You&#39;ll own full-cycle searches across our go-to-market organization, from high-volume roles like Sales Development Representatives to specialized roles in Customer Success and Partnerships. You&#39;ll partner closely with GTM leaders and hiring managers, run searches end to end, and help improve how our recruiting team operates as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a good fit for someone who is organized, proactive, and comfortable owning their work. You should enjoy learning a new business quickly, work well with autonomy, and care about giving every candidate a thoughtful experience.&lt;/p&gt;
