&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hands-on Treasury Operations Analyst to own the day-to-day execution of Mercury&#39;s cash management and reporting processes. This is an execution- and build-focused role: you&#39;ll manage cash movements and approvals, maintain Treasury&#39;s core reporting cadence, and — critically — design and build the automated tools and workflows that let Treasury operate without relying on manual spreadsheet work or costly third-party platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re especially interested in candidates who are fluent with modern AI and prioritize process and reporting automations. If you&#39;ve automated processes to gain scale and efficiency we want to hear about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cash Management &amp;amp; Operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and approve daily cash movements across Mercury&#39;s accounts, ensuring accuracy, proper authorization, and timely settlement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain daily cash positioning and reporting, tracking balances across operating, reserve, and partner bank accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage reserve account funding across Mercury&#39;s partner bank relationships, ensuring balances comply with contractual requirements and reconciling reserve calculations against underlying agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cash forecasting by maintaining and refreshing short-term cash flow models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own bank account access and rights administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Automation (Build Focus):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain automated cash and liquidity reporting — reducing reliance on manual spreadsheet processes and off-the-shelf treasury management tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable tools for cash positioning, reserve tracking, and reporting workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and recurring reporting packages (e.g., ALCO materials, deposit summaries, liquidity metrics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own data pulls and validation from internal systems (e.g., NetSuite, Snowflake) to support reporting accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously look for manual, error-prone, or repetitive Treasury processes and propose/build automated replacements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Accounting to ensure cash activity, reserve movements, and facility transactions are properly reflected in the GL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Data/Analytics teams to acquire cash data feeds from third-party banks to support Treasury and broader Finance reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ALCO and management reporting with accurate, well-formatted, timely inputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with ad hoc requests from the Treasurer and broader Finance team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at a fintech, bank, or other regulated financial institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of experience in treasury operations, corporate treasury, FP&amp;amp;A, or a related finance/accounting function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail — this role involves approving real money movements and compliance-sensitive reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data modeling skills; comfort with large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience thoughtfully transitioning manual processes to scalable automations to gain efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL and/or willingness to learn (Snowflake, Omni experience a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to NetSuite or similar ERP/GL systems a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication; comfortable producing clean, concise reporting for senior stakeholders and external counterparties (third-party banks, lenders)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter comfortable in an ambiguous, build-as-you-go environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to prototype automated processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with partner bank / BaaS reserve account structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior use of Treasury Management Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with deposit sweep networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Federal Reserve account operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management skills — this role will involve owning trackers and multi-workstream initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
